    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="6">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ine">Ine</ref> 6</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">{L} Gif hwa gefeohte on cyninges huse, sie he scyldig ealles his ierfes, ⁊ sie on cyninges dome, hwæðer he lif age þe nage.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If someone fights in the king’s house, let him be liable for all he owns, and let it be up to the king’s judgment whether he should keep his life or not.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If anyone fights in the king's house, he shall forfeit all his property, and it shall be for the king to decide whether he shall be put to death or not.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif hwa on cyningas huse gefeohte, sy he scyldig ealles his yrfes, ⁊ sy on cyninges dome, hweþer he lif age ðe nage.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
